	(descr "Puya USON-8 3x3x0.55 mm (package code DF), P0.8, leads to the body edge, two exposed tie-bar tabs 0.20 x 0.80 on the centre line; PY25Q128HA DS Rev 2.0 p106 (drawing QRPD-0077), pins p4 (pin 1 top-left, 1-4 down the left). No vendor land: IPC-7351B least density, lands 0.94 x 0.29 at x +-1.28 (toe 0.25 past the body), tab lands 1:1 = pad 9 (no electrical function stated, leave unconnected). https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20250117/E5397163A091235CFF3CDB19865BC1CE.pdf | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 1.58 (D 2.90/3.00/3.10 -> 1.55 max + 0.03), heel 0.81 kept (>= D/2-Lmax 0.80), width 0.29 kept (IPC L 0.285), tab lands unchanged")
